cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or its data, please cite it using the metadata from this file."
type: software
title: "Forest carbon in the U.S. greenhouse gas inventory: an independent, open reproduction"
abstract: >-
  Per-state forest carbon flux estimates with confidence intervals, produced
  independently of the U.S. federal greenhouse gas inventory. Includes
  notebooks that compare them against the published Forest Service estimates,
  so anyone can check the agreement themselves.
authors:
  - family-names: "Mihiar"
    given-names: "Chris"
    affiliation: "CTrees"
repository-code: "https://github.com/ctrees-products/lulucf-frf-demo"
url: "https://ctrees.org"
# The code is MIT and the data tables in data/ are CC BY 4.0 (see LICENSE-data).
# CFF reads a list of licenses as alternatives (OR), so only the code licence is
# given here.
license: MIT
date-released: "2026-07-31"
keywords:
  - forest-carbon
  - greenhouse-gas-inventory
  - lulucf
  - forest-inventory
  - fia
  - carbon-accounting
  - reproducible-research
  - open-science
references:
